  "description": "After a bad first year at university, Michael returns to school after a taking a year off to manage his mental health. His life has mostly returned to normal but he still has a feeling of uncertainty. Afraid of getting hurt, he keeps everyone at a distance until the \"ice queen\" catches his attention. Through his attempt to pursue her, he realizes in order to melt her heart, he has to open up his. Slowly, the distance between them begins to close..\n\n(Source: Webtoon)",
